.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbit-mcp 1  "mcp " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-mcp \- Run as an MCP server over stdio, so AI tools can use Orbit
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit mcp\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run as an MCP server over stdio, so AI tools can use Orbit
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable ANSI colors
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit mcp
  claude mcp add orbit \-\- orbit mcp
